Bundled Apache-2.0 Theme Files
------------------------------
The curated `.theme` files shipped under `themes/` and embedded into
`btop-config` are adapted from upstream `aristocratos/btop` themes under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, with v1.4 pause/follow banner keys populated for
Windows 11 TrueColor rendering:

- themes/dracula.theme
- themes/tokyo-night.theme
- themes/gruvbox_dark_v2.theme
- themes/nord.theme
- themes/onedark.theme
- themes/kanagawa-wave.theme
- themes/solarized_dark.theme
- themes/monokai.theme
- themes/everforest-dark-medium.theme
- themes/adwaita-dark.theme
